# --- KEEP TRACKED (do NOT ignore) ---
# The committed §4 PoC fixtures the CRYP-03 verifier tests load, and the pinned
# build tool, are the whole point of this directory — force-include them so no
# broader rule can sweep them out. clearing.wasm + clearing_final.zkey let CI
# verify the §4 proof WITHOUT re-running the trusted setup (build.mjs).
!vkey.json
!verification_key.json
!proof.json
!public.json
!clearing.wasm
!clearing_final.zkey
!circom.exe
